## Output Format Guidelines

New / modified files:

* Only complete file contents, never partial
* Bookended with identical `¤filepath = "path/to/file.py"¤` lines at the start and end of each file block
* All code contents enclosed in language-appropriate triple backticks between the bookends

Files to be deleted:

* Preceded by `¤deletelist¤`
* Simple list of paths formatted as `¤filepath="path/to/obsolete.py"¤`

---

